===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc}} {{term|σπέρμα||sperm||tr=sperma|sc=polytonic}} + {{term|ζῷον||living thing|sc=polytonic|tr=zōon}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˌspɜːmətə(ʊ)ˈzəʊɒn/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|spermatozoa}}

# {{cytology}} The reproductive cell or [[gamete]] of the male, carried in [[semen]], that fertilizes the [[ovum]] to produce the [[zygote]].

